<title>USA: Arden Realty buys properties.</title>
<headline>Arden Realty buys properties.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arden Realty Inc said it acquired eight suburban office properties for about $97 million.</p>
<p>The purchases bring to 42 the total number of properties in Arden's portfolio. They encompass 60 buildings and 6.3 million square feet.</p>
